, we're humans.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_21","text":"Where did you come from?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_22","text":"What do you mean? Where else could we have come from other than Xion?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_23","text":"I've never heard of this \"Xion\".","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_24","text":"That transport aircraft behind you, did you come here on that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_25","text":"Indeed we did. We call it Tetrapod.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_26","text":"Although one of the calipers is broken at the moment, so it'd be more accurate to call it Tripod.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_27","text":"... Do you know anything about Nikkes?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_28","text":"You mean what Roam was talking about? It asked if we were Nikkes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_29","text":"Can you tell us where we are? We're not familiar with this place, and I'm unable to pull up any coordinates.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_30","text":"Rapi, are you thinking what I'm thinking?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_31","text":"... Yes. That seems to be the case.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_32","text":"I'll contact the Deputy Chief.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_33","text":"Please do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_34","text":"Oh no, not the D-Wave again?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_35","text":"Uh oh...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_36","text":"??","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_37","text":"Why don't we all have a seat?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_38","text":"We have a lot to discuss.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_39","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_39","text":"Soon after.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_memoriesteller_01","bgArt":"eventscene_memoriesteller_01","image":null,"bgm":"collab_bgm_sb_camp_01","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_40","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_40","text":"As expected, the three humans before us were summoned to this world due to a D-Wave anomaly.","jump":null,"exit":false,