:event_ce006_1_01_e_54","text":"Everyone together and happy. Heehee haha.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_55","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_55","text":"After their explanation, we fill them in as to where they are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_56","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_56","text":"About our world.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_57","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_57","text":"The surface overtaken by a mysterious enemy called Raptures, forcing humankind underground.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_58","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_58","text":"About Nikkes, the ultimate weapons created to do battle against the Raptures.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"artcity_d","bgArt":"artcity_d","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["ce006_03","ce006_npc_01","ce006_01","roam","rapi","anis","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_59","text":"It really is awfully similar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_60","text":"I realize it may be a little insensitive to compare our situations like this, but given that we're at least on the surface of our planet, we're a little better off than you all here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_61","text":"Then... you guys aren't human?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_62","text":"Well... I guess not.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_63","text":"To be honest though, you can't really tell the difference unless we get hurt or something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_64","text":"We found it hard to believe that humans could still exist up on the surface,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_65","text":"which is why Roam and all of us reacted the way we did.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_66","text":"I see. It just caught us a bit off guard, that's all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_67","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_68","text":"All right. I understand that this isn't the world we came from.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_69","text":"And from what I'm hearing, this kind of thing has happened a couple of times before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_70","text":"So my question is, is there a way we can go back to our world?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_71","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_71","text":"There is a way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_72","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_72","text":"You need to awaken, or defeat, rather, the Rapture known as Gatekeeper. It's what is responsible for bringing you here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_73","text":"Based on our investigations, the source of this D-Wave is somewhere within a 40-kilometer radius of our current location.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_74","text":"The D-Wave signal covers a wide area, but unlike previous cases,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_75","text":"it is significantly weaker this time around.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_76","text":"Also, anything that Gatekeeper summons normally emits a large amount of D-Wave energy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_77","text":"But all of you are emitting rather weak D-Wave energy, enough to be barely detectable from the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_78","text":"And what would be the explanation behind that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_79","text":"The patterns change every time, so it's difficult for us to come up with anything conclusive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_80","text":"It's easier to simply accept that it's different this time around, and move on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_81","text":"... Got it. The situation inherently doesn't make sense, so attempting to analyze it won't help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_82","text":"Then, should we search this area?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_83","text":"In theory, yes, but it's a wide area to comb over.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_84","text":"Yikes...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_85","text":"That's not something we'd be able to cover on foot. We'll have to use the Tetrapod.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_86","text":"Any chance the Ark could lend some assistance?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_87","text":"They're searching as we speak, but it's slow going.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_88","text":"How about venturing out with an exosuit?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_89","text":"I don't think that's a good idea. They're meant to be piloted solo. If they fall behind, that'd be the end of that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_90","text":"Well, we certainly wouldn't want that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_91","text":"I guess we need to focus on repairing the Tetrapod.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_92","text":"That does seem to be the only option. Let's just hope that the damage is something manageable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_93","text":"Is there any place nearby we could find spare parts?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_94","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_94","text":"We could request them from the Ark, but it would take some time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_95","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_95","text":"Whenever we're up on the surface and need spare parts, we typically have to go scavenging for them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_96","text":"Wow, another way our situations are similar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_97","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_97","text":"If you tell us what parts you need, we can help you search for them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_98","text":"Much appreciated, but we have no way of knowing if the specs would match.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_99","text":"If Rapi's firearm is any indication, I'd say our technology doesn't differ too wildly from theirs. The specifications aren't identical, of course, but it should be possible to get it to work.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_100","text":"All right then, let's head out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_101","text":"Exploring an unknown world, how exciting!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_102","text":"I will go with them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_103","text":"You two should stay back and give the Tetrapod a proper once-over.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_104","text":"What? Why don't we go together?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_105","text":"Securing a way back is our top priority. We need to make sure there's nothing else wrong with the ship other than the caliper.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_106","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_107","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_108","text":"Don't worry. I'll be back.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_109","text":"Have you got any combat experience?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_110","text":"I don't think I'm too bad.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_111","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_03","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_111","text":"Don't undersell yourself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce006_npc_01","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_112","text":"You're better than \"not too bad\".","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_113","text":"Good. Then let's go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_114","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_114","text":"I'm going too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_115","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_115","text":"It might be dangerous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_116","type":"Speech","speaker":"roam","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_116","text":"I am a transport robot. I can carry parts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce006_1_01_e_117","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_ce006_1_01_e_117","text":"... All right, if you insist.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}